==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Coffin Zoge]]s (200%) spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Zuche]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Coffin Zoge]] (150%) spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Coffin Zoge]]s (200%) spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**3 [[Zuche]]s spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**2 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring a strong anti-Zombie to deal with the Zuches and Coffin Zoge. [[Trash Cat (Special Cat)|Trash Cat]] is a good unit that counters this stage without forcing you to resort to stronger units.

